# Surplus steps beyond what the triac loads absorb: relay 1 comes in at 500 W of
# export, relay 2 at 1000 W, each once; with import they go out in reverse order,
# relay 1 a minute after relay 2 (the settle time after a change). If relay 2 were still
# within its minimum ON time, relay 1 would go out first: see relay_import_first.scn.
include common.scn
duration 425

at 0    -300
at 30   -300
at 30   3000   # triac loads on (1500 W), 1500 W exported
at 200  3000
at 200  4500   # relay 1 on (750 W), still 2250 W exported
at 340  4500
at 340  -300   # import, once relay 2's minimum ON time is over
at 425  -300

expect 110 pin 8 off    # exporting, but within its minimum OFF time from power-up
expect 190 pin 8 on
expect 190 pin 9 off
expect 330 pin 9 on
expect 390 pin 9 off
expect 390 pin 8 on     # waits for the settle time after relay 2
expect 420 pin 8 off
expect switches 8 1 1
expect switches 9 1 1
